{"parentUuid":"f7c9ffa3-eb27-4e01-884a-155653fb8ce0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"aa14e9cc78e7c5b07","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V2XhsB5ccEMF4BSGVLp6ae","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa14e9cc78e7c5b07\nOn branch worktree-agent-aa14e9cc78e7c5b07\nnothing to commit, working tree clean\nstatement: >-\n  A background command started inside a foreground sub-agent is terminated\n  when that sub-agent gives its final response, and the command's receipt says\n  so.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/tools-reference#background-commands\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/fg-subagent-bash\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\ncommit f860ff366b50328d62a3ff06a1cd76d39e84245f\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 16:44:15 2026 +0200\n\n    codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\n    \n    Codex tells the agent a failed command's output like a success's; the failure is only in the event stream's command_execution item (status failed, exit_code). Recorded with the real codex; the cell lists that as a deviation, and the mock does the same.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/shell_result_test.go      | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/events/stream.go               |  7 ++-\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/run.yaml      |  2 +\n .../shell-exit-status/samples/20261003-142833/SEAL |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/events.jsonl           | 22 +++++++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/exit.txt               |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/payloads.jsonl         |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stderr.txt             |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stream.jsonl           | 16 +++++\n ...8-34-01a1022a-acf2-7e