{"parentUuid":"04c22289-693a-43e2-916b-5db7f954a731","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9af44ced-bc96-4c0c-851c-b7a4d67027a3","agentId":"aa14e9cc78e7c5b07","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014c6HVDqT8MiCZ1PZkxve1W","type":"tool_result","content":"--- FAIL: TestACommandAForegroundSubagentStartedInTheBackgroundEndsWithItsResponse (0.98s)\n    subagent_shell_test.go:142: \n        \tError Trace:\t/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa14e9cc78e7c5b07/cursor-mock/e2e/002_scenario/subagent_shell_test.go:142\n        \tError:      \tNot equal: \n        \t            \texpected: []string{\"preToolUse\", \"beforeShellExecution\", \"postToolUse\"}\n        \t            \tactual  : []string(nil)\n        \t            \t\n        \t            \tDiff:\n        \t            \t--- Expected\n        \t            \t+++ Actual\n        \t            \t@@ -1,6 +1,2 @@\n        \t            \t-([]string) (len=3) {\n        \t            \t- (string) (len=10) \"preToolUse\",\n        \t            \t- (string) (len=20) \"beforeShellExecution\",\n        \t            \t- (string) (len=11) \"postToolUse\"\n        \t            \t-}\n        \t            \t+([]string) <nil>\n        \t            \t \n        \tTest:       \tTestACommandAForegroundSubagentStartedInTheBackgroundEndsWithItsResponse\nFAIL\nFAIL\tgithub.com/sloprail/harness-mocks/cursor-mock/e2e/002_scenario\t3.502s\nFAIL","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cf617e59-2aec-4514-84b1-08bdb6795f7c","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:57:23.776Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"04c22289-693a-43e2-916b-5db7f954a731","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa14e9cc78e7c5b07","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
