{"parentUuid":"d5381767-c61c-4bb0-b04e-b51ece89c459","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa14e9cc78e7c5b07","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffgUpu8FXMdZfMWfxY6H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both cells for `foreground-subagent-bash-ends-with-response` are resolved, and PR #112 is merged. All CI checks passed first, and the final `sr-checks` run had no refusals.\n\n**Cursor: supported, with deviations**\n- **Recorded run:** `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/foreground-subagent-bash-ends-with-response`. A foreground `Task` sub-agent starts a shell with `block_until_ms:0` and answers; the command is gone before the parent's next call. The stream carries an `aborted` `task_notification`.\n- **Deviations:**\n  - The receipt is only `{shell_id,pid}` and does not say the command will be terminated; this is a `capability-grounding` deviation.\n  - The mock dispatches a sub-agent only from a `Task` call that carries a mock-only `script`, always in the foreground.\n  - A hook that refuses the `Task` call does not stop it.\n  - `subagentStart` and `subagentStop` do not fire.\n  - These four are `modeled-surface`.\n- **Mock code:** new `agent_task.go` dispatches the sub-agent. The sub-agent shares its parent's background shells (`registry()` delegates to the parent). When it answers, its running shells are ended and reported through the existing `notificationFrame`, which now reports `aborted` for a killed shell. A new `Pid` on the task gives the receipt a real process id.\n- **Test:** `cursor-mock/e2e/002_scenario/subagent_shell_test.go`, marked `sr:proves foreground-subagent-bash-ends-with-response/cursor`. It checks the sub-agent's hook sequence and receipt against the recording, that the command is dead before the parent's next call, and the order of the `aborted` notice.\n\n**Codex: unsupported**\n- The recording is `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/foreground-subagent-bash-ends-with-response`. The sub-agent's backgrounded `sleep` was still running after the sub-agent had finished, and no receipt exists. There is no mock code or marker.\n\nMy earlier shared-core edits had been overtaken by other agents' work on `origin/main` (a background shell in the cursor mock already existed). I redid the change on top of it, as above. No refusals about other capabilities remained.\n\nI saw one unrelated failure: `TestAHookPastItsTimeout...` in `cursor-mock/e2e/001_hooks` failed once under heavy load, passed when run alone, and passed in CI."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":184,"cache_read_input_tokens":258681,"output_tokens":834,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":184},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":258681,"cache_creation_input_tokens":184,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":184,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffgUpYJBrJPvwbnZXSiN","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"a0ceee16-16b4-4316-997c-38b6ea8a1eea","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:15:49.529Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-aa14e9cc78e7c5b07","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a11c0a040e3cf682b"}
